#. The title of a worksite in the list of where to work: what is done (Build a better one, or Repair what is damaged), to which province's roads, industry or housing. {province} is a province's name, never translated; {mode} and {type} are codes that choose between the branches, so keep every branch.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "worksite.title"
msgid "{mode, select, REPAIR {Repair} other {Build}} {province}'s {type, select, TRANSPORT {roads} INDUSTRIAL {industry} CIVIL {housing} other {works}}"
msgstr "{mode, select, REPAIR {Reparar} other {Construir}} {type, select, TRANSPORT {carreteras} INDUSTRIAL {industria} CIVIL {vivienda} other {obras}} en {province}"
